menu "Zigbee NVRAM Migration Example"

    config ZB_EXAMPLE_RUNTIME_NVS_PARTITION
        bool "Using NVS partition added at runtime"
        default n
        help
            When enabled, the NVS partition for Zigbee dataset storage will be created at runtime,
            instead of the pre-defined one in the partition table. This is useful when the old device
            does not have a NVS partition or the pre-defined NVS partition does not have enough space
            for Zigbee dataset storage.

endmenu
